{"story_id":40830,"updated_at":"2026-10-24T03:20:20","headline_en":"Harmeet Desai and Yashaswini Ghorpade reach Asian Table Tennis mixed doubles semifinals","headline_hi":"हरमीत देसाई और यशस्विनी घोरपड़े एशियाई टेबल टेनिस मिक्स्ड डबल्स सेमीफाइनल में पहुंचे","payload_en":{"story_id":40830,"headline":"Harmeet Desai and Yashaswini Ghorpade reach Asian Table Tennis mixed doubles semifinals","counts":{"articles":2,"independent_sources":2,"outlets":2},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["The Hindu","Times of India"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":40830,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-10-24T03:20:20","category":{"primary":["life"],"secondary":["sport-films"]},"places":[],"people":["Harmeet Desai","Yashaswini Ghorpade","Asian Table Tennis Championships","Payas Jain","Syndrela Das","Chinese Taipei","Gool Nasikwala","Huang Youzheng"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"Harmeet Desai and Yashaswini Ghorpade defeated Park Ganghyeon and Lee Daeun 3-2 in the quarterfinals on Friday.","ids":[66967],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"Gool Nasikwala and Kalyan Jayant won gold in mixed doubles at the 1952 Asian Championships, and Yatin Vyas and Meena Parande secured silver in the event in 1954.","ids":[66950,66951],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"India previously won mixed doubles medals at the tournament in 1952 and 1954, and the country's last medal in the event was in 1954.","ids":[66953,66972],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"Harmeet Desai and Yashaswini Ghorpade reached the semifinals of the Asian Table Tennis Championships on Friday, and they secured at least a bronze medal in mixed doubles.","ids":[66938,66970],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"The duo won the fourth game 11-9 and the decider 11-9 on 24 October 2026.","ids":[66942,66943],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Harmeet and Yashaswini won 3-0 against Indonesia in the preceding round, and they had a first-round bye.","ids":[66945,66949],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Payas Jain and Syndrela Das did not reach the medal stage.","ids":[66974],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Payas Jain and Syndrela Das lost 0-3 to Yi Chen and Huang Youzheng in their quarterfinal match on Friday.","ids":[66968],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"The Indians won the opening game 11-6 today, and it lost the next two games.","ids":[66940,66941],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Harmeet and Yashaswini advanced to the quarterfinals after defeating Chinese Taipei 3-1 in the previous round.","ids":[66944],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"For the first time in 72 years, India has won a mixed doubles medal at the continental championships.","ids":[66971],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"The victory in five games highlighted the duo's tenacity and capacity to bounce back.","ids":[66948],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Harmeet Desai and Yashaswini Ghorpade will face Miwa Harimoto and Sora Matsushima in the semifinals.","ids":[66952],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"A victory in the semifinal would send Harmeet and Yashaswini into the final.","ids":[66973],"class":"single","sources":[1]}]],"section_keys":["news","background","happened","happened","happened","happened","performers","performers","performers","numbers","numbers","next","next"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/more-sports/others/harmeet-desai-and-yashaswini-ghorpade-assure-historic-medal-for-india-at-asian-tt-championships/articleshow/135140676.cms","outlet":"Times of India","title":"First time in 72 years! Harmeet, Yashaswini assure historic medal for India","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/india-wins-historic-first-mixed-doubles-medal-at-asian-tt-in-72-years/article71617948.ece","outlet":"The Hindu","title":"India wins historic 